              "normalization_notes": [],
              "raw_id": "ev03",
              "source": "model",
              "source_chunk_id": null
            }
          ],
          "quote": "Immediately, the Earthmen established what they called\n\"corporations\"--Zurian trading companies under terrestrial control. The\nobject of the visit was trade."
